s and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"warning","name":"Warning"},{"anchor":"Custom-backends","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Custom backends"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these as ","type":"text"},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide"},"references":{"documentation-header.png":{"identifier":"documentation-header.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]},{"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header~dark@2x.png","traits":["2x","dark"]}],"type":"image","alt":"YubiKeys in a row"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/GettingStarted":{"title":"Getting Started","role":"article","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/gettingstarted","abstract":[{"text":"Prepare your project to connect to the YubiKey via NFC, SmartCard, Lightning and USB HID.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted"},"doc://yubikit-swift.Y